        "kicker": "ACT II",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 很快就卖掉了",
          "en": "Sold at once"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "画还没完全晾干，7月就被画商买下。那年底，一本时装杂志刊登了它的彩色复制品；第二年，它在第七届印象派画展上展出。",
          "en": "That July, a dealer bought the painting. Later that year a fashion magazine published a colour reproduction of it, and the following spring it was shown at the seventh Impressionist exhibition."
        }
      },
