    "transcript": [
      {
        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 河边的春天",
          "en": "Spring by the river"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1881年春天，雷诺阿又回到沙图的富尔奈斯餐厅。4月，他在露台上开始画这两个女孩。",
          "en": "In spring 1881, Renoir returned to the Maison Fournaise at Chatou. In April, he began painting these two girls on the terrace."
        }
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 很快就卖掉了",
          "en": "Sold at once"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "画还没完全晾干，7月就被画商买下。那年底，一本时装杂志刊登了它的彩色复制品；第二年，它在第七届印象派画展上展出。",
          "en": "That July, a dealer bought the painting. Later that year a fashion magazine published a colour reproduction of it, and the following spring it was shown at the seventh Impressionist exhibition."
        }
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "zh": "第三幕 · 来到芝加哥",
          "en": "To Chicago"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1933年起，它收藏在芝加哥艺术博物馆，成为那里最受欢迎的作品之一。",
          "en": "Since 1933 it has been in the Art Institute of Chicago, where it is one of the most popular paintings."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
